---
// Groundwork's agent graph: search → grade → write → verify, with its two retry loops.
---

<figure class="agent-graph rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-[#14122b] p-4 text-white sm:p-6">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 700 300" class="h-auto w-full" role="img" aria-labelledby="ag-title ag-desc">
    <title id="ag-title">Groundwork agent graph</title>
    <desc id="ag-desc">
      A question is triaged, then the agent retrieves documents and grades them. If they are not good enough it
      expands the search and retrieves again. Then it writes an answer and verifies every claim, rewriting if a claim is
      unsupported, before finishing.
    </desc>
    <defs>
      <marker id="ag-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
        <path d="M0 0 10 5 0 10z" fill="#a5b4fc"></path>
      </marker>
      <marker id="ag-loop" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
        <path d="M0 0 10 5 0 10z" fill="#fbbf24"></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <g fill="none" stroke-width="1.6">
      <!-- main path -->
      <path d="M78 150H104" stroke="#a5b4fc" marker-end="url(#ag-arrow)"></path>
      <path d="M186 150H212" stroke="#a5b4fc" marker-end="url(#ag-arrow)"></path>
      <path d="M294 150H320" stroke="#a5b4fc" marker-end="url(#ag-arrow)"></path>
      <path d="M402 150H428" stroke="#a5b4fc" marker-end="url(#ag-arrow)"></path>
      <path d="M510 150H536" stroke="#a5b4fc" marker-end="url(#ag-arrow)"></path>
      <!-- search-again loop: grade → expand → retrieve -->
      <path d="M361 128V80H253V100" stroke="#fbbf24" stroke-dasharray="5 4"></path>
      <path d="M253 100V126" stroke="#fbbf24" stroke-dasharray="5 4" marker-end="url(#ag-loop)"></path>
      <!-- rewrite loop: verify → write -->
      <path d="M577 172V226H469V196" stroke="#fbbf24" stroke-dasharray="5 4"></path>
      <path d="M469 196V174" stroke="#fbbf24" stroke-dasharray="5 4" marker-end="url(#ag-loop)"></path>
    </g>

    <g font-family="JetBrains Mono, ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle">
      <circle cx="62" cy="150" r="14" fill="#312e81" stroke="#a5b4fc"></circle>
      <text x="62" y="186" fill="#c7d2fe" font-size="10">question</text>

      {
        [
          { x: 104, label: 'triage' },
          { x: 212, label: 'retrieve' },
          { x: 320, label: 'grade' },
          { x: 428, label: 'write' },
          { x: 536, label: 'verify' },
        ].map((n) => (
          <g>
            <rect x={n.x} y="128" width="82" height="44" rx="10" fill="#1e1b4b" stroke="#6366f1" />
            <text x={n.x + 41} y="155" fill="#eef2ff">
              {n.label}
            </text>
          </g>
        ))
      }

      <!-- nodes on the loops -->
      <rect x="276" y="62" width="64" height="30" rx="8" fill="#422006" stroke="#fbbf24"></rect>
      <text x="308" y="81" fill="#fde68a" font-size="11">expand</text>
      <text x="307" y="50" fill="#fbbf24" font-size="10">not enough? search again (max 2)</text>
      <text x="523" y="250" fill="#fbbf24" font-size="10">unsupported claim? rewrite (max 1)</text>

      <!-- verified answer leaves the graph -->
      <path d="M618 150h26" stroke="#86efac" stroke-width="1.6" marker-end="url(#ag-arrow)"></path>
      <circle cx="660" cy="150" r="14" fill="#14532d" stroke="#86efac"></circle>
      <text x="660" y="186" fill="#86efac" font-size="10">answer</text>
    </g>
  </svg>
  <figcaption class="mt-3 text-center font-mono text-[11px] text-indigo-200/70">
    Both loops are capped, so the agent can't retry forever or run up an API bill.
  </figcaption>
</figure>
